    <string name="notify_title">Bank notifications</string>
    <string name="notify_explainer">PAM can read the notifications your banking apps post and turn payments into entries you confirm.\n\nAndroid gives a notification reader everything, including your messages, so PAM checks each one on the phone first: unless it has an amount with a currency in it, the notification is dropped and never leaves the device. What does get sent is never recorded as spending — it waits in the app until you tap to confirm it.</string>
